e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7gBMoNEfQkEQ7kNvwHBFzJn&_nc_oc=Adril3QChdWBnlPjkttPclSmhg4Pr9zWs7xebNFoOctbbzYV3kzt1KSwaySCQZVya1M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2BN2jpNlHrBHhaBUAbHhMsy8IFweQWwtEvUu-g6R9cYg&oe=69DF71B9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=41oqh78RDvoQ7kNvwFlR--N&_nc_oc=AdrpjLWw7aiS7uui635YYDkvZLYGAcnhI-0YlAoofvdJ7LtA9tAdsMpUJgHT-DI-U1s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3qo9Ppd_IT390IUDuQ4yhvXbvWgvMXI9RuTYMi1ONutQ&oe=69DF8153"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UOtvkqUj-AgQ7kNvwHoAmIm&_nc_oc=AdqyHwOEKz1Vq6hmquQYlv_SsMBKJJLXXC_nKIYt615ykqdhlORoL-NjdvimRSz0C-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af31-0pF4pBa_x07N7ZZt9tcnajYYowytMljfHRt2bdoTQ&oe=69DF8CFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c1mMg8X3nVgQ7kNvwEFdsJ7&_nc_oc=AdowBT9wxtMSTacBroUfvsIeVaIavHb6scCsaUnCarHMhbkq5ftITc3HwAGzJtyO6R0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af28bEhbwdjFO7W-cUAnGvTt_ghjjmdcp2TdX4y20JvE3Q&oe=69DF8E4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HPhN-ISHbj4Q7kNvwHOP-We&_nc_oc=AdrhA4Ypkdoa9lW1x8yn1VaG2b9lw7SUJMrYIBD2E5yBnFbbhDvRD7IUXFBrXjZYOKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3AUALO1hb9Oao2nYX0_I1Lv1uzywjp_ukAznQ3VAPPug&oe=69DF777E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se